---
// The OhrTech SDK's two parts, side by side: where the code runs is what tells them apart.
---

<div class="products not-content">
	<a class="product" href="/management-api/">
		<span class="ohr-badge live">Available</span>
		<h3>Management API</h3>
		<p class="where">From your servers and tools</p>
		<p>
			Manage every device in your fleets over HTTPS: status, settings, messages, remote control in
			your own app, and remote ADB. Sign in as a service account or as a person.
		</p>
		<p class="meta"><code>api.ohrtech.net</code> · .NET SDK · OpenAPI</p>
		<span class="go">Read the docs →</span>
	</a>
	<a class="product" href="/device-sdk/">
		<span class="ohr-badge soon">Coming soon</span>
		<h3>Device SDK</h3>
		<p class="where">From your app, on the device</p>
		<p>
			Let the app you ship on OhrTech devices work with the OhrTech Agent: change device settings,
			manage network and power, lock the screen to one app, reboot on a schedule and install its own
			updates.
		</p>
		<p class="meta">Android library</p>
		<span class="go">What's coming →</span>
	</a>
</div>

<style>
	.products {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 20rem), 1fr));
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}
	.product {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--ohr-card-line);
		border-radius: var(--ohr-radius);
		background: var(--ohr-card-bg);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: border-color 0.15s;
	}
	.product:hover {
		border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
	}
	h3 {
		margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
	}
	.where {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--ohr-eyebrow);
	}
	p {
		margin: 0;
	}
	.meta {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	.meta code {
		font-size: 0.85em;
	}
	.go {
		margin-top: auto;
		padding-top: 0.5rem;
		font-weight: 650;
		color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
	}
</style>
